  "steps": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a pan over medium heat. Season the chicken with a little salt and cook for 5 to 6 minutes per side, until golden and cooked through with no pink in the middle. Leave to cool, then chop into small pieces.",
    "In a bowl, mix the mayonnaise, plain yogurt, curry powder, mustard, lemon juice, salt, and black pepper until smooth.",
    "Stir in the chopped chicken, apple, raisins, celery, and spring onion until everything is evenly coated.",
    "Toast the bread if you like, then lay over the lettuce and spoon on the curried chicken salad.",
    "Top with the remaining bread slices, press gently, and cut in half to serve."
